<title>USA: Kodak CEO to head US-China business panel.</title>
<headline>Kodak CEO to head US-China business panel.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The US-China Business Council said on Thursday it has elected Eastman Kodak Co chairman and chief executive officer George Fisher as the council's chairman for 1997-98.</p>
<p>Fisher succeeds Donald Staheli, former Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Continental Grain Co, the council said.</p>
<p>The US-China Business Council, which consists of 300 U.S. companies, is the principal organization of American companies active in trade and investment with the China.</p>
</text>
